port devel/simdjson
type port
target @any
reason "Rebuild with ports GCC 13 so this C++ library links libstdc++.so.6 instead of base gcc8 libstdc++.so.9. www/node24 is built with gcc13 (needs C++20); mixing it with .so.9 system deps loads two libstdc++ runtimes in one process and corrupts V8 Zone allocator (mksnapshot SIGSEGV). Unify all of node24 C++ deps on .so.6."

mk set USE_GCC_VERSION "13"
